<title>UK: Rheinhyp adds 500 mln marks to March 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinhyp adds 500 mln marks to March 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increase to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, jont lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commcerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    22.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED. PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
</text>
